<!DOCTYPE html>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    {{> head}}
    <title>Backup</title>
    <style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}body{background:#fff;font-family:system-ui;color:#1e293b}.container{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem}h1{font-size:2rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.5rem}.subtitle{color:#64748b;margin-bottom:2rem}.info-box{background:#dbeafe;color:#1e40af;border:1px solid #93c5fd;border-radius:0.75rem;padding:1rem;margin-bottom:2rem}.section{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:0.75rem;padding:1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem}.section-title{font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #e2e8f0;padding-bottom:0.75rem}.backup-status{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2rem;margin-bottom:2rem}.status-item{padding:1rem;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:0.5rem;border-left:4px solid #3b82f6}.status-label{color:#64748b;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem}.status-value{font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b}.btn{padding:0.75rem 1.5rem;border:0;border-radius:0.5rem;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;margin-right:0.5rem}.btn-primary{background:#3b82f6;color:#fff}.btn-primary:hover{background:#2563eb}.btn-success{background:#10b981;color:#fff}.btn-success:hover{background:#059669}.table-container{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:0.75rem;overflow:hidden}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}thead{background:#f8fafc;border-bottom:2px solid #e2e8f0}th,td{padding:1rem;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:0.9rem}th{font-weight:600;color:#1e293b}tr:hover{background:#f8fafc}.badge{display:inline-block;padding:0.375rem 0.75rem;border-radius:9999px;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:600;background:#dcfce7;color:#166534}</style></head><body>{{> navbar}}<div class="container"><h1>💾 Database Backup</h1><p class="subtitle">Manage system backups and restore points</p><div class="info-box">💡 Automatic backups run daily at 2:00 AM. Last backup: Nov 10, 2025 02:15 AM (195 GB)</div><div class="backup-status"><div class="status-item"><div class="status-label">Last Backup</div><div class="status-value">Nov 10, 2:15 AM</div></div><div class="status-item"><div class="status-label">Total Backups</div><div class="status-value">45</div></div></div><div class="section"><div class="section-title">Backup Actions</div><div style="display:flex;gap:1rem"><button class="btn btn-success" onclick="alert('Creating backup...')">⬇️ Create Backup Now</button><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="alert('Scheduling restore...')">📂 Schedule Restore</button></div></div><div class="section"><div class="section-title">Backup History</div><div class="table-container"><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Size</th><th>Type</th><th>Status</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Nov 10, 2025</td><td>195 GB</td><td><span class="badge">Automatic</span></td><td style="color:#16a34a">✓ Complete</td><td><a href="#" style="color:#3b82f6;text-decoration:none">Download</a> | <a href="#" style="color:#3b82f6;text-decoration:none">Restore</a></td></tr><tr><td>Nov 09, 2025</td><td>192 GB</td><td><span class="badge">Automatic</span></td><td style="color:#16a34a">✓ Complete</td><td><a href="#" style="color:#3b82f6;text-decoration:none">Download</a> | <a href="#" style="color:#3b82f6;text-decoration:none">Restore</a></td></tr><tr><td>Nov 08, 2025</td><td>189 GB</td><td><span class="badge">Automatic</span></td><td style="color:#16a34a">✓ Complete</td><td><a href="#" style="color:#3b82f6;text-decoration:none">Download</a> | <a href="#" style="color:#3b82f6;text-decoration:none">Restore</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div>{{> footer}}</body></html>